(HTTP Request Methods:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.078 g
40. 462. Td
( The primary ways a client \(e.g., a web browser\) communicates with a server. The two most common) Tj
T* (methods for sending data are GET and POST.) Tj
