BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.078 g
40. 405. Td
( Special built-in PHP variables that are always available in all scopes throughout a script. They do not require) Tj
T* (`global` keyword to be accessed inside functions or methods. `$_GET` and `$_POST` are examples of) Tj
T* (superglobals.) Tj
ET
