40. 163. Td
( An operation is idempotent if it produces the same result no matter how many times it is executed. GET) Tj
T* (requests are generally considered idempotent \(retrieving data multiple times doesn't change server state\),) Tj
T* (while POST requests are not \(submitting a form multiple times might create multiple entries\).) Tj
ET
